    <string name="privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_intro">No sign-in. No RojInk server. No ads.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Your bookmarks, browsing history and translation cache are stored on this device. Websites and your search engine receive normal browsing requests. RojInk does not scan for translation until you tap Start. Google receives the text to translate. With on-device OCR, image pixels stay on your device; with optional Cloud Vision, Google also receives the image being scanned.\n\nPrivate tabs use isolated cookies, skip history and translation disk caches, and delete their profiles when closed. Private browsing does not hide you from the sites you visit, your network or translation providers.</string>
    <string name="about">About RojInk</string>
    <string name="about_body">A browser for readers. Made to bring manga, manhwa, menus and the open web into your language.\n\nWeb engine: Android System WebView\nTranslation: Google Translate\nOn-device text recognition: Google ML Kit\nArabic-script font: Noto Naskh Arabic (SIL Open Font License)</string>
